    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b136b284fcb223e28321cc906e3b7dd2.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b136b284fcb223e28321cc906e3b7dd2.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b136b284fcb223e28321cc906e3b7dd2.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Drive, drift &amp; deliver</strong></u> your way through <strong>5</strong> unique destructible <strong>worlds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b6a1cbc2d7395c81a5f3308fe8939efa.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b6a1cbc2d7395c81a5f3308fe8939efa.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b6a1cbc2d7395c81a5f3308fe8939efa.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Hit the road</strong></u> <strong>solo</strong> or gather up to <strong>3 friends</strong> to join the convoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/72442aa1355c7543a2f58871bf3e4843.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/72442aa1355c7543a2f58871bf3e4843.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/72442aa1355c7543a2f58871bf3e4843.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong><u>electric manipulation powers</u></strong> to <strong>boost</strong> for speed &amp;\u00a0<strong>zap</strong> to fend off enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e04712160eed1f8f4aea69596477eb83.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e04712160eed1f8f4aea69596477eb83.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e04712160eed1f8f4aea69596477eb83.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collect</u></strong> new <strong>characters</strong> &amp; <strong>cosmetics</strong> throughout your epic galactic adventure.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b136b284fcb223e28321cc906e3b7dd2.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b136b284fcb223e28321cc906e3b7dd2.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b136b284fcb223e28321cc906e3b7dd2.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Drive, drift &amp; deliver</strong></u> your way through <strong>5</strong> unique destructible <strong>worlds</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b6a1cbc2d7395c81a5f3308fe8939efa.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b6a1cbc2d7395c81a5f3308fe8939efa.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/b6a1cbc2d7395c81a5f3308fe8939efa.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Hit the road</strong></u> <strong>solo</strong> or gather up to <strong>3 friends</strong> to join the convoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/72442aa1355c7543a2f58871bf3e4843.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/72442aa1355c7543a2f58871bf3e4843.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/72442aa1355c7543a2f58871bf3e4843.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong><u>electric manipulation powers</u></strong> to <strong>boost</strong> for speed &amp;\u00a0<strong>zap</strong> to fend off enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e04712160eed1f8f4aea69596477eb83.poster.avif?t=1754568819\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e04712160eed1f8f4aea69596477eb83.webm?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540530/extras/e04712160eed1f8f4aea69596477eb83.mp4?t=1754568819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Collect</u></strong> new <strong>characters</strong> &amp; <strong>cosmetics</strong> throughout your epic galactic adventure.</p>",
    "short_description": "Cabbie!\u00ae is a reimagined driving arcade game where you boost, drift and jump your way to victory in a frantic race against the clock, for one to four players.",
